<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n453" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγένειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γένειον</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>beardless, boyish</i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγένειόν τι εἰρηκέναι</span> to speak <i>like a
			boy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>J. Tr.</u>
				29
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Eun.</u>
				9
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-είως, ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VS</u>
					1.8.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγένειοι, οἱ</span>, <i>boys</i> within the age to enter for
			certain prizes at the games, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				8.54
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				9.89
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				1373
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				21.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				833c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				2.965
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				6.6.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γενεά</span>) <i>childless</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				1891.29
			</span></i> (Delph.), <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
